Z||000011||Spyder||10-09-2000||10:06 PM||||    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif">    <BR>Sorry Couldn't help it.<P><BR>Archie, <BR>How long does it take you to do a full engine install with the engine, with like a crate motor carbed?<BR>Start to finish with the radiator upgrade. Just curious, a guesstimate would be fine.<p>[This message has been edited by Spyder (edited 10-09-2000).]||||reg||12
