Z||000013||Archie||10-10-2000||08:25 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spyder:<BR><B>   <BR>Archie, <BR>How long does it take you to do a full engine install with the engine, with like a crate motor carbed?<BR>.]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>In & out my door about 3 to 4 weeks.<P>Actual labor time 40 to 50 hours.<P>With proper scheduling and planning someone bringing a car from out of town and planning to wait for it to be done, can be driving it home in 4 or 5 days.<P>Archie<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 10-10-2000).]||||reg||1
